From 40abf02a1cecbfef65452932cd47b8b8cbdb7239 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 21:02:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Retarget platform LLM defaults to *@openrouter.

With UniLLM making gpt-*@openai native OpenAI (not OpenRouter), move
production defaults, act profiles, observation scaling keys, and related
tests to openai/<id>@openrouter. Accept OPENROUTER_API_KEY in provider
credential validation.
